  "corridorNote": "Modelled on the Carroll and Milton Petrie European Sculpture Court in the evening. A large peaked triangular skylight roofs what reads as an outdoor courtyard wedged between two buildings: one wall smooth pale stone with illuminated rectangular panels and arched doorways, the other a facade of dark red brick set with white stone arches and circular medallions. A floor-to-ceiling glass wall closes the far end, and white marble figures stand down the paving under warm spotlights.",
